"block in log first quick on dc0 proto tcp/udp from any to any port = 81\n"
msgstr "# Block incoming Netbios services\nblock in log first quick on dc0 proto tcp/udp from any to any port = 137\nblock in log first quick on dc0 proto tcp/udp from any to any port = 138\nblock in log first quick on dc0 proto tcp/udp from any to any port = 139\nblock in log first quick on dc0 proto tcp/udp from any to any port = 81\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/firewalls/_index.adoc:2168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
